UID:FnF19umfCsbbmWfqwKWNo
SUMMARY:Wings over Houston Meet at Greet
DTSTAMP:20260717T061751Z
DTSTART:20260717T183000Z
DESCRIPTION:Hey photo pit fans\, at our first Wings Over Houston Photo Pit 
	meet up we had a nice turnout at the magnificent Eureka Heights Brewery…..
	so much so\, let’s do this again!  How does July 17th sound?  Sounds great
	 so save the date of July 17th at 6:00pm till 9:00pm at the wonderful Eure
	ka Heights Brewery.  Let’s all meet up talk airshow and photography.  We w
	ill have airshow performers in attendance to ask questions to about how th
	ey fly the airshow and any other questions you have……….like what is their 
	favorite food?  J  Of course\, the Amazing Photo Pit Team and movers and s
	hakers of the airshow staff will be there for your questions and entertain
	ment.  Please feel free to ask any of us behind the scenes questions.  Ple
	ase RSVP.\n\nhttps://www.eurekaheights.com/event/wings-over-houston-meet-a
	t-greet-2026-07-17/\n\nFrom Eureka Heights Brewery
URL:https://www.eurekaheights.com/event/wings-over-houston-meet-at-greet-20
	26-07-17/
LOCATION:Tap Room\, 941 W 18TH ST.\, Houston\, TX\, 77008\, United States
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:eureka-heights-brew-co
CATEGORIES:Eureka Heights Brewery
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT1H
END:VEVENT
